# The Worker's secrets. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for these while deploying.
# From a terminal: npx wrangler secret put SETUP_CODE
# For local development (npm run dev), copy this file to .dev.vars.

# Needed once: the first person to sign in on a new server types it and becomes the owner.
# 8 characters or more. After that it does nothing.
SETUP_CODE=choose-a-code-only-you-know
